    "detailed_description": "Fields of Gold is a charming and engaging casual farming game where your goal is to transform plots of land into a prosperous farm.<br />\r\nBegin your journey by tilling small patches of earth, growing and harvesting a variety of crops. As your farm flourishes, you can expand your fields and unlock the ability to build manufactories, where your crops are processed into valuable goods. Each successful harvest and expansion brings new challenges and opportunities, testing your farming skills and strategic thinking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut it's not all peaceful farming \u2013 watch out for the cheeky rabbits that are always on the hunt for tasty crops \u2013 especially yours! Arm yourself with dynamite and protect your fields from these ravenous invaders. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you turn your Fields of Gold into a thriving agricultural empire, or will the rabbits have the last laugh?",
